  <span class="grow" id="feedText">Every figure below is baked into this file, taken <b>Thu, 27 Aug, 15:57 HKT</b>. A chat, mail or preview window cannot run scripts or fetch data — open this in Safari or Chrome and it goes live on its own.</span>
